# the screen reader (fm1-reader, announce.c): a reader listens, and each page, knob, chord, list row, card, question,
# message and the transport is said once, in the screen's own text (the words file says it in full); chord and note
# names in words; what changes by itself while playing (the bar, the section, the chord) is not said.
# Keys: A3 4, C4 7, E4 11, G4 14.
wait 300
listen
wait 100
said Home page. S1, follow: Style Pop, Tempo 105, Transpose C, Prog follow. Stopped. Groove A. Play three keys for a chord. The band follows your chords.
# a chord from the keys: its name, at once
key 7 down
key 11 down
key 14 down
wait 50
said C major
key 7 up
key 11 up
key 14 up
key 4 down
key 7 down
key 11 down
wait 50
said A minor
key 4 up
key 7 up
key 11 up
wait 200
# a knob: its name and value once it settles; the transpose a note's name in words
spin K3 -2
wait 300
said Transpose B flat
spin K3 2
wait 300
said Transpose C
spin K2 1
wait 300
said Tempo 106
# a progression from HOME + a white key: the message
press HOME
tapkey w0
release HOME
wait 300
said PROGRESSION P1 Pop
# a page settles before it is said; its chords on WHERE
tap ARP
wait 300
said Progression, page 1 of 2. S1, P1 Pop: Bar 1, Beat 1, Root C, Type major.
said_none
where
wait 40
wait 100
said P1 Pop: bar 1 C major, bar 2 G major, bar 3 A minor, bar 4 F major.
# SELECT: the button's next page
turn SELECT 1
wait 300
said Progression, page 2 of 2. S1, P1 Pop: Length 4, Beats 4, Bass none, Name Pop.
turn SELECT -1
wait 300
said Progression, page 1 of 2
# the cursor's chord: Bar moves, Root and Type with it; a type in words
spin K1 2
wait 300
said Bar 3, Root A, Type minor
spin K4 1
wait 300
said Type seventh
spin K4 -1
wait 300
said Type minor
# the transport
tap PLAY
wait 50
said Play
# playing: the bars and their chords go by, nothing said
wait 4000
said_none
tap PLAY
wait 50
said Stop
# a list: its name and its row, with its place; SELECT moves, ALGORITHM changes
tap SEL
wait 300
said Progression list. CLEAR CHORD, action, 10 of 13
turn SELECT 1
wait 300
said STEP bar, 11 of 13
turn ALGO -1
wait 300
said STEP half, 11 of 13
# a question: at once, and how to answer it; HOME no (back to the list)
turn SELECT 2
wait 300
said CLEAR PROGRESSION, action, 13 of 13
tap SEL
wait 50
said CLEAR P1? SEL: yes. HOME: no.
tap HOME
wait 300
said Progression list. CLEAR PROGRESSION, action, 13 of 13
tap HOME
wait 300
said Progression, page 1 of 2
# a help card (a button held alone a second): its button first
press FX
wait 1100
said FX button. Effects. The reverb and the chorus every instrument sends to.
release FX
wait 300
# HOME held: the shortcuts
press HOME
wait 700
said HOME held: white keys pick a progression
release HOME
wait 300
# the Sound page: the instrument and its sound; a note's name in words (after the message the edit says)
tap EDIT
wait 300
said Sound, page 1 of 2. S1, Pop, Groove A, C1 Acoustic Grand: Sound Acoustic Grand, Type Chord 1, Low G 3, High G 5.
spin K3 -1
wait 300
said Low F sharp 3
# ALGORITHM: the instrument, said by its message (not again as a page)
turn ALGO 1
wait 300
said C2 Clean Guitar
said_none
# the Mixer: pan in words
tap LFO
wait 300
said Mixer, page 1 of 2
spin K2 -24
wait 300
said Pan left 2
# a message: SAVE
tap SAVE
wait 50
said SAVED
# undo (HOME + REC): what it undid, then the knob it moved back
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
wait 300
said Pan right 22
# WHERE: everything again, then the controls
where
wait 40
said Mixer, page 1 of 2. S1, Pop, Groove A, C2 Clean Guitar: Volume 70, Pan right 22, Reverb 50, Chorus 40. Stopped, tempo 106, unsaved.
where
wait 40
said black keys: instrument. SELECT: page. ALGO: instrument.
# the Song page: a white key adds a section (its message); while the song plays, its sections and bars go by unsaid
tap HOME
tap HOME
wait 300
said Song, page 1 of 2
tapkey w0
wait 300
tapkey w1
wait 300
said Section 2 added: P2 Ballad, A
# WHERE on Song: the sections, a message of their own
where
wait 40
said Section 1: P1 Pop, A. Section 2: P2 Ballad, A.
tap PLAY
wait 50
said Play
wait 500
said Section 1, Prog P1, Groove A, Repeat x1
wait 9000
said_none
# HOME while the song plays: where it is, on WHERE only
tap HOME
wait 300
said Home page. S1: Style Pop, Tempo 106, Transpose C, Prog Song.
wait 3000
said_none
where
wait 40
said Playing, unsaved. Groove A, section 1 of 2. Chord
tap PLAY
wait 50
said Stop
